WEBVTT

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:04.970
A relic from the holy war?

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:05.970
Yes.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:11.980
It may have been on a military plane 
that crashed near Lake Kannawa long ago.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.600
Lake Kannawa is a man-made lake.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.840
A dam was built there over 40 years ago,

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:22.160
at the expense of an entire village.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:26.120
What if that dam was built 
to seal the relic away?

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:30.590
And what if that seal 
was now about to be broken?

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.560
I see.

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:40.950
So it was the Taishi Bureau 
that put these ideas in your heads.

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:44.730
Damn it! Why are you trying to stop us?!

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.530
There's a relic from the holy war

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:48.740
in the same area where 
Nagisa's gone missing!

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:50.920
I don't know what's going on,

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.980
but we can't let Nagisa come 
into contact with that relic!

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.790
Anything but that!

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.120
It's true.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:03.580
Akatsuki Nagisa did break 
the seal on a relic from the holy war.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:05.050
She did?!

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:09.070
I guess you still have no memory of it, huh?

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:13.390
At any rate, I cannot allow you 
to leave Itogami Island.

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:17.520
Just relax within my barrier 
until things calm down.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.280
Please, Natsuki-chan!

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:08.450
Lædingr, the chain forged by the gods, eh?

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:12.780
You do have such unusual 
magical tools, Natsuki.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:16.380
But they are no match for me.

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:19.390
Nina-san?! But how...

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:22.890
Kanon was concerned about you two.

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:29.640
Onii-san, Yukina-chan, this way!

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:30.920
Kanon-chan!

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:31.600
Senpai!

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:33.020
R-Right!

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:37.880
It does pain me to rebel 
against my landlady in this way,

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:41.930
but your methods were 
simply unacceptable, Natsuki.

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:44.790
If you wish to fight, here I am.

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:50.710
Thanks a lot, Kanase.

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:56.160
W-Well, I was worried 
about Nagisa-chan, too...

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:02.850
It appears your negotiations 
with Minamiya Natsuki failed.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:04.630
Kisaki Kiriha!

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.500
I'm certain now.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:11.020
Of what?

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:14.650
Minamiya Natsuki and the Man-made 
Island Management Corporation

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:20.160
knew about the plan proceeding 
at Lake Kannawa from the beginning.

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:24.730
They probably made a deal 
with the Lion King Organization.

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:27.170
Does that upset you?

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:30.620
Do you have a more logical explanation?

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.170
Well...

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:36.660
Arguing about it here 
won't give us any answers.

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:39.840
We just have to go there 
in person and find out.

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:41.540
How gallant of you.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:44.680
But without the assistance 
of Minamiya Natsuki,

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.880
how do you intend to reach the mainland?

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.850
You can't make an omelet 
without cracking some eggs.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:51.690
We'll ask Vatler for help.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:54.130
The <i>Oceanus Grave II</i>, then?

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:56.860
You may find that method 
to be rather costly.

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:59.480
Well, what else can we do? 
There's no other way!

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:02.010
You are not entirely out of options.

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:05.250
I've arranged one 
of the Taishi Bureau's business jets.

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:08.740
These are fake ID cards.

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:12.110
Sadly, though, there isn't an extra for her.

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:16.080
You, girl! Stop right there!

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:19.250
If you don't comply, we will use force!

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:22.920
Hey! What the hell's going on, Mogwai?!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:27.550
<i>There must be some people who don't 
want you leaving Itogami Island.</i>

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.720
<i>Oh, turn right at the next corner.</i>

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:32.690
What?! It's a dead end!

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:34.690
<i>No, this is the right way.</i>

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:36.960
<i>I figured this might happen, so...</i>

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:44.450
<i>I called in an escort for you.</i>

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:47.600
You're... Tank?!

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:49.050
Indeed!

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:51.020
I am Lydianne Didier,

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:54.880
and I have come per 
the request of Mogwai-dono!

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:59.200
Empress, head to parking 
spot 40 on the south side!

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:02.960
I have a Didier Heavy Industries 
cargo plane waiting there.

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:07.600
Hey, these IDs...

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:10.710
have Himeragi and me 
classified as husband and wife!

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:12.010
How wonderful...

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:13.570
No, no, no, no, no!

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:16.390
Why the hell does it say 
Himeragi is 29 years old?!

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:19.440
I'm not against older wives, 
but that's pushing it!

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:23.840
It was the most suitable 
fake ID card I could get.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.470
Just try to act the age it gives you.

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:26.870
For the love of...

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:30.240
Okay, I guess there's 
nothing we can do about that.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:32.510
But what's your angle, Kisaki Kiriha?

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:36.000
Why are you guys doing all this for us?

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:38.200
To be mean.

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:38.880
What?!

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:43.210
The interests of the Taishi Bureau and the 
Lion King Organization oppose each other.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:48.880
So if they're doing everything in their power 
to keep you away from Lake Kannawa,

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:51.340
how could I not take advantage of that?

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.500
It seems they haven't given 
you any information at all.

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:57.270
If that bothers you, 
you're welcome to leave right now.

00:06:57.760 --> 00:07:00.030
I'll take over for you.

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:02.920
No. Whatever my superiors are planning,

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:04.900
I will continue to observe Senpai.

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:09.510
That is the duty I have been tasked with.

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:13.380
I see. Then I suppose 
nothing more can be done.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:17.080
Stop! Stop the car, please!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:17.870
Now!

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:19.220
Whoa!

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:32.170
I told you I wasn't going to 
let you go, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:37.430
I see. You didn't let Akatsuki Kojou leave.

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:40.560
You were just waiting for him 
to go somewhere with fewer people,

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.780
Witch of the Void.

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:44.230
Correct, little girl.

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:47.250
If that idiot were to cut 
loose in the middle of town,

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:49.710
it'd be a pain in the ass to clean up after him.

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:54.240
That said, it's not like I want to 
play war with you lot, either.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:57.920
Akatsuki Kojou, if you just come quietly,

00:07:57.920 --> 00:08:00.160
no one will have to get hurt.

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:04.630
Like hell I can do that!

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:07.080
I'm going to save Nagisa!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.590
After that,

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:11.590
you can give me supplementary lessons, 
or throw me in the prison barrier, or whatever!

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.610
So right now, just let me do this!

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:15.050
No.

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.590
Why?!

00:08:16.590 --> 00:08:21.760
If the thing at the bottom of 
Lake Kannawa really is a holy war relic,

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:25.070
and you come in contact with it, 
you won't come back unscathed.

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:31.070
Especially now, when you still 
don't remember anything about Avrora.

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:33.190
Avrora?

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:35.160
What am I supposed to remember?!

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:39.520
Avrora sleeps within your sister.

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:43.340
Avrora Florestina, the one you killed...

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:46.180
a fragment of the Fourth Progenitor.

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:55.630
Senpai!

00:08:57.440 --> 00:08:59.600
I can assure you of one thing.

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:04.370
What the Lion King wants 
is Avrora's power, and nothing more.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:07.300
They don't consciously wish 
to put Akatsuki Nagisa in danger.

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:09.560
The opposite, in fact.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:12.350
In order to fulfill their goal,

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:15.670
they'll probably fight 
to the death to protect her.

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.530
I see.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:22.500
So that's why you're helping 
the Lion King Organization.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.950
I guess I can still respect you, then.

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:29.840
And Himeragi...

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:32.310
The Lion King Organization 
didn't betray you.

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:34.850
They just didn't tell you about all this

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:37.810
to make sure I wouldn't try 
to pull anything.

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:39.160
Senpai...

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:42.560
I'm glad you told me all this, Natsuki-chan.

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:46.840
Now I definitely need to get to 
the mainland, whatever it takes!

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:48.850
Are you saying you remember everything now?

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:52.040
No, if anything, I'm even more confused now.

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:54.370
But there's just one thing

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:57.280
that I'm absolutely sure of.

00:09:58.100 --> 00:10:00.640
No matter how they try to rationalize it,

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:04.050
I won't let anyone use Nagisa 
or the Avrora inside her

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:06.730
for their own selfish gains.

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:09.000
And if anyone tries to do that,

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.970
I'll crush them myself.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:14.760
From now on, this is my fight!

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:22.980
No, Senpai.

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:24.640
This is our fight.

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:26.060
Himeragi...

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.040
Hey...

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:32.520
The you I'm looking at is a double 
that you made with magic, right?

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.060
And if it is?

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:36.440
Then I don't need to hold back!

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:40.570
Come, Regulus Aurum!

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:44.720
Awaken, Rheingold!

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:53.740
The Fourth Progenitor's Familiar...

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:55.970
is being held down by force?

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:02.360
I won't let this go any further!

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:03.810
Stay out of this!

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:09.830
Senpai!

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:15.070
Onii-san!

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.400
What the hell happened?!

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:44.920
<i>They're gremlins that screw 
with electronic functions.</i>

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:47.680
<i>Island Guard attack mages must've sent them.</i>

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:50.720
Isn't there anything you can do, Mogwai?!

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:52.000
<i>'Fraid not.</i>

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.320
<i>Thanks to those gremlins, 
all electronic functions in this area ar—</i>

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:56.700
Mogwai?!

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:59.100
Oh, crap!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.000
You!

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:16.880
Priestess of Cain, he awaits you.

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:18.740
Go to him.

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:21.040
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:21.870
<i>Little miss!</i>

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:24.270
<i>Island Guard reinforcements 
are on your tail!</i>

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:27.980
Empress, the cargo plane is ready to depart!

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:30.440
Okay! Go, Tank!

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:36.970
All will proceed as my king has guided it.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:49.330
We're done here. You still want to fight?

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:53.420
As I said, this is my fight, too.

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:00.400
An illusion?!

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:08.950
Amateur. How could you fall 
for such a simple trick?

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:12.290
It's over.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.270
Not yet, it isn't.

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:19.020
What're you playing at?

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:22.930
As the Six-Blade Priestess, 
also known as the Black Sword Shaman,

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:26.950
it would disturb me if you lost so easily 
to a Sword Shaman from the Organization.

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:30.610
Have it your way.

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:32.380
The end result won't change.

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:34.660
Big talk, for a witch.

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:36.330
I'll kill you!

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:54.230
Sorry, Kanase.

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:56.850
I didn't mean for you to get involved.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.710
Don't worry about me.

00:13:58.710 --> 00:14:01.520
It was my choice to come with you.

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:03.700
We'll get out of here somehow...

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:06.720
My strength...

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:10.500
I'm draining your magic out of you...

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:12.790
through that Familiar outside.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.840
Natsuki-chan?! But how?!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:19.500
We're inside my dream, after all.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:22.240
I just made myself look my real age.

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:26.460
After all that fighting, 
you dragged Kanase into your mess.

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:31.140
And after I kept your identity as 
the Fourth Progenitor secret all this time...

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:34.560
It didn't matter.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:39.600
I had a feeling you weren't 
just an ordinary person, anyway.

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:42.290
I see.

00:14:43.100 --> 00:14:44.470
Thanks, Kanase.

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:48.990
Tell me, Natsuki-chan.

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:51.750
Why are you going to such lengths to stop me?

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:55.280
I told you. If you go, 
you're going to get hurt.

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:58.170
What is the Lion King Organization planning?

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:00.800
And is she really...

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:02.770
Is Avrora really sleeping within Nagisa?

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:13.350
The Lion King Organization isn't looking 
to dig up the holy war relic.

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:16.230
What they're after is the seal.

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:21.690
A god-slaying relic that has slept 
for so long at the bottom of Lake Kannawa,

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:25.520
a weapon of mass destruction, 
is on the verge of awakening.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:29.700
Their goal is to seal it away 
for good this time.

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:34.740
That means you'd just be 
in the way, Fourth Progenitor.

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:36.980
Because the god-slaying relic

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:41.230
might react to my magic, 
causing it to awaken faster?

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:42.850
Exactly.

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:44.230
But that means...

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:48.600
If Avrora is inside Nagisa, 
isn't she in danger, too?!

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:49.610
So why?!

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:56.170
Avrora Florestina knows the spell 
that can seal the weapon of mass destruction.

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:59.780
You probably don't remember it,

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:02.200
but the twelfth Kaleid Blood

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:06.490
is a vessel meant to contain 
and seal the soul of the Fourth Progenitor.

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:07.610
A vessel?

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:12.150
But if it does that, 
what'll happen to Avrora's soul?

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:14.110
Nothing.

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:16.570
That girl is already gone.

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:21.200
The part of her that your sister 
is gradually giving her life to keep here

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:22.990
is no more than a lingering thought.

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:27.130
It's only a single fragment 
of a soul that is already lost.

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:33.050
Why didn't you tell me all 
this in the first place?

00:16:33.350 --> 00:16:35.240
If I had, would you have given up?

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:36.520
No.

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:37.700
That's why.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:43.030
Relax. I'll make you forget all this 
before you leave here.

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:44.320
Screw that!

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:47.900
You expect me to just sit back 
and accept all this?!

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:51.440
Onii-san!

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:54.910
Damn it... My strength...

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:58.460
Honestly... I have such useless students.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:02.640
Between those impudent girls outside

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:03.960
and you...

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:06.900
You're all a bunch of weaklings 
who can't even touch me.

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.710
What do you expect to do against 
a weapon of mass destruction?

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.650
This is only getting worse.

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:20.590
I'm sorry, Kisaki-san,

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:23.720
but could I ask you 
to buy one minute of time for me?

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:27.700
One minute against that witch? 
You'll be risking your life.

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:29.840
I know that.

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:31.530
Please do it anyway.

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:32.870
You...

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:36.790
If you go down as the loser 
after putting me through all this,

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:38.490
I'll make you regret it,

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:39.820
Himeragi Yukina!

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:49.760
Execute Rhododactylos.

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:52.010
Astarte...

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:55.460
I hope you're prepared to be punished.

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:58.460
Apologize, Master.

00:17:59.530 --> 00:18:04.240
I have to commend you on your way 
with women, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:08.070
You even managed to get 
a homunculus who can't defy her master

00:18:08.070 --> 00:18:10.160
to take your side!

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:14.950
Miss Kanase.

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:17.410
Remove your clothes.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:18.470
Huh?

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:19.750
Remove...

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:20.960
Hang on, Astarte!

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:23.420
What are you trying 
to make me do to Kanase?!

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:27.130
Answer: blood donation.

00:18:29.510 --> 00:18:31.080
All right.

00:18:41.110 --> 00:18:45.520
Onii-san, please take my blood.

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:46.970
Kanase...

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:52.330
I knew that you were always 
doing this with Yukina-chan.

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:56.080
That's how you saved me.

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:03.090
So this time, it's my turn.

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:14.960
You have to...

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:19.370
save Nagisa-chan, Onii-san...

00:19:36.350 --> 00:19:38.400
Divine possession?

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:42.600
But the slightest mistake could cause her 
to lose her personality...

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:47.110
She's willing to go 
that far for Akatsuki Kojou?

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:56.050
You okay, Astarte?

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:57.880
Leave the rest to me.

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:03.910
So you've sunk your venomous 
fangs into Kanase now,

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:05.450
you lecherous brat?

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:06.310
Yeah.

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:11.610
And now, another Familiar I couldn't 
control before is about to wake up.

00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:15.560
What did I tell you? 
You can't use your Familiars here.

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:18.130
Yeah, that's true.

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:21.320
But I can use them outside!

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:28.200
I, Akatsuki Kojou, successor
to the blood of Kaleid Blood,

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:30.750
now release your constraints!

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:34.790
Come, first Familiar,

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:36.880
Mesarthim Adamas!

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:46.310
Is that...

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:48.400
the Fourth Progenitor's...

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:57.490
I, Sword Shaman of the High God, as a priestess of the Lion, beseech thee...

00:20:58.340 --> 00:20:59.550
Snow?

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:03.360
No... they're crystals 
created by divine vibrations.

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:06.320
Dawn light of exorcism, spirit wolf of snowy mist...

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:13.420
Grant me the divine might of thy steel,

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:16.850
that I may smite a hundred evil spirits!

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:21.880
This divine energy... I see.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:26.850
This is why you were chosen 
to be the Fourth Progenitor's observer.

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:42.030
Very well. We're even.

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:46.470
You mean... you're going to let us go?

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:52.790
I don't want you breaking Itogami Island 
or the prison barrier any further.

00:21:58.060 --> 00:21:59.040
Huh?!

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:02.490
I thought I'd give you 
a little parting gift.

00:22:03.060 --> 00:22:05.710
Parting gift... You don't mean...

00:22:16.620 --> 00:22:17.580
Here.

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:24.490
I know you're planning to ditch the rest 
of your winter supplementary lessons.

00:22:24.490 --> 00:22:28.110
Turn those in, and you're off the hook. 
You should be grateful.

00:22:28.110 --> 00:22:30.990
Huh? Oh... That's what you meant...

00:22:30.990 --> 00:22:35.120
What? Did you think I was 
going to let you suck my blood?

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:35.920
Huh?

00:22:36.480 --> 00:22:37.360
Hmph.

00:22:37.360 --> 00:22:42.290
Just do your best to show up 
to class on time after winter break.

00:22:44.650 --> 00:22:46.040
Natsuki-chan...

00:22:47.190 --> 00:22:50.710
Don't address your teacher 
with "chan," idiot.

00:24:24.800 --> 00:24:27.290
So you really did suck her blood?!

00:24:27.290 --> 00:24:28.880
I didn't have a choice!

00:24:28.880 --> 00:24:31.580
Besides, it was only Kanase, 
not Natsuki-chan...

00:24:31.580 --> 00:24:34.810
You tried to suck 
Minamiya-sensei's blood, too?!

00:24:34.810 --> 00:24:37.850
So you really do prefer small girls!

00:24:37.850 --> 00:24:39.400
Hey, don't get the wrong idea!

00:24:39.400 --> 00:24:42.690
She wasn't in her usual loli image! 
She looked like a real woman teacher,

00:24:42.690 --> 00:24:47.460
dressed her age, 
with actual boobs like... Get it?!

00:24:47.600 --> 00:24:50.870
A real woman teacher, you say?

00:24:51.120 --> 00:24:53.960
With boobs, too? I see.

00:24:54.610 --> 00:24:58.710
You really are an indecent person, Senpai!

00:24:58.710 --> 00:25:01.190
No, you've got it all wrong! 
I had no choice!

00:24:58.900 --> 00:25:01.170
I swear, Senpai!

00:25:01.170 --> 00:25:03.310
Just listen to me!

00:25:01.170 --> 00:25:03.310
I don't care if you flirt, but...

00:25:03.310 --> 00:25:04.920
We're not flirting!

00:25:06.450 --> 00:25:08.400
Shouldn't you be leaving—

00:25:11.430 --> 00:25:15.090
It seems the Witch of the Void 
is more naïve than I thought.

00:25:15.810 --> 00:25:19.340
No, I suppose that is her true nature.

00:25:19.620 --> 00:25:21.300
Paper Noise...

00:25:21.510 --> 00:25:22.500
You!

00:25:22.650 --> 00:25:24.740
Your voice... Are you...

00:25:24.910 --> 00:25:27.280
Pleased to meet you, Fourth Progenitor.

00:25:27.280 --> 00:25:30.570
I am one of the Three Saints 
of the current Lion King Organization.

00:25:30.570 --> 00:25:32.720
My name is Shizuka Koyomi.

00:25:33.090 --> 00:25:36.910
I am sorry, but per the collective 
will of the Lion King Organization,

00:25:36.910 --> 00:25:40.240
I have come to prevent you 
from leaving this island.
